  "solution": "**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d4d295550b9de3075718413c37d6065d8a24374d60a3ac0807a98b717585d85d.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 5 ÷ 8 of 2 - 10 ÷ 5 of 8 + 6 ÷ 15 × (7 - 4) of 2 - 2\n\n⇒ 5 ÷ 16 - 10 ÷ 40 + 6 ÷ 15 × 6 - 2\n\n⇒ (5/16) - (1/4) + (2/5) × 6 - 2\n\n⇒ (5/16) - (1/4) + (12/5) - 2\n\n⇒ (1/16) + (2/5)\n\n**⇒ 37/80**",
